                  "content": "Step into everyday comfort with these women’s sneakers, designed for all-day wear. The breathable upper keeps your feet cool, while the cushioned insole and flexible outsole support daily movement from commute to casual outings. A clean, versatile silhouette pairs easily with jeans, joggers, or dresses, making this pair a reliable choice for work, travel, and weekend style.",
